pom.xml
```

## Docker Setup

App and MongoDB run as separate containers on the same Docker network so they can talk to each other.

```
docker network: app-network
 ├── spring-app (port 8080)
 └── mongo (port 27017)
```

## How to run locally

```bash
./mvnw clean package
docker build -t calculator-app .
docker network create app-network
docker run -d --name mongo --network app-network mongo:6.0
docker run -d --name spring-app --network app-network -p 8081:8080 calculator-app
```

App runs at `http://localhost:8081/calculate`

## Database

Database: `calculatordb`

Stores: example
{
    _id: ObjectId('6a6c6e962814ce9acedba45c'),
    firstNumber: 445,
    secondNumber: 5,
    operation: '-',
    result: 440,
    _class: 'com.example.demo.model.Calculation'
  }
